; padding: 6px 10px; background: #1c1917; color: #fafaf9; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center;\">6 votes</div></div><div class=\"fmd-text-box\" data-slide-object-id=\"obj-caption\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 64px; top: 460px; width: 520px; font-size: 14px; color: #78716c;\">Drag notes to regroup · captured at the Portland store workshop</div></div>"
